'''Welterweight Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. He was added in [[Version 5.9 Update|Version 5.9]] [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]] increases his health and range. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.3 Update|Version 10.3]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] and could be unlocked by playing the Rare Cat Capsule.

